      <link>http://localhost:1314/articles/consumption/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/articles/consumption/</guid>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Inhalation via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1314/articles/smoking/&#34; class=&#34;redlink&#34;&gt;Combustion&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Classic method to include:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Joint&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Blunt&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Pipe&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Bong&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Hookah&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Inhalation via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1314/articles/vaporizing/&#34; class=&#34;redlink&#34;&gt;Vaporizor&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Edibles&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Tinctures&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Tea&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Capsules&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Frequently Asked Questions</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1314/articles/frequently-asked-questions/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/articles/frequently-asked-questions/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;consumption&#34;&gt;Consumption&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Can cats eat cannabis leaves?&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;Yes. Leaves are full of nutrients and some cats seem to like them.&#xA;There is no harm in cats eating your fan leaves.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;imgcard&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 20%&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1314/images/cat1.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;A cat eating a fan leaf&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption class=&#34;imgcard-caption&#34;&gt;A cat eating a fan leaf&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Why do I get the munchies?&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;Cannabinoids stimulate the release of a hunger molecule called &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1314/articles/ghrelin/&#34; class=&#34;redlink&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;ghrelin&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;.&#xA;Also food tastes better!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Edibles vs. Smoking&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;When you inhale cannabis, you are inhaling Delta-9 THC, and goes from lungs to blood stream, so the effects are very quick.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pests</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1314/articles/pests/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/articles/pests/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Pests are an issue that plague all growers.&#xA;Like most things, an ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure.&#xA;Once an infestation gets out of control, it can often be hard to recover.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;common-types-of-pests&#34;&gt;Common Types of Pests&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;aphids&#34;&gt;Aphids&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Aphids love to hang out on stems and eat delicious leaves.&#xA;They are tiny, soft-bodied insects that like to hang out in large groups.&#xA;They generally amass on stems, or under leaves.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
